nd-reimported STEP passes the gate; validate() alone can miss round-trip failures.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"mesh_nonmanifold_edge\",\n      \"where\": [\n        -110.483,\n        -38.596,\n        -72.706\n      ],\n      \"shared_by_triangles\": 4,\n      \"hint\": \"two surface sheets meet >2-ways here (BRepCheck-valid but a CAD scorer rejects it) \\u2014 a self-touch; cut a thin relief or redo the boolean\",\n      \"diagnostic_class\": \"mesh_topology\",\n      \"repair_family\": \"separate_self_touch_or_redo_boolean\",\n      \"next_step\": \"Inspect for coincident or tangent sheets meeting >2 ways; redo the boolean or add explicit clearance/relief in build123d code.\",\n      \"verify_after_repair\": \"Run export(..., 'step') so the written-and-reimported STEP passes the gate; validate() alone can miss round-trip failures.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"mesh_nonmanifold_edge\",\n      \"where\": [\n        -110.478,\n        -38.596,\n        -72.706\n      ],\n      \"shared_by_triangles\": 3,\n      \"hint\": \"two surface sheets meet >2-ways here (BRepCheck-valid but a CAD scorer rejects it) \\u2014 a self-touch; cut a thin relief or redo the boolean\",\n      \"diagnostic_class\": \"mesh_topology\",\n      \"repair_family\": \"separate_self_touch_or_redo_boolean\",\n      \"next_step\": \"Inspect for coincident or tangent sheets meeting >2 ways; redo the boolean or add explicit clearance/relief in build123d code.\",\n      \"verify_after_repair\": \"Run export(..., 'step') so the written-and-reimported STEP passes the gate; validate() alone can miss round-trip failures.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"mesh_nonmanifold_edge\",\n      \"where\": [\n        -110.508,\n        -38.487,\n        -72.706\n      ],\n      \"shared_by_triangles\": 4,\n      \"hint\": \"two surface sheets meet >2-ways here (BRepCheck-valid but a CAD scorer rejects it) \\u2014 a self-touch; cut a thin relief or redo the boolean\",\n      \"diagnostic_class\": \"mesh_topology\",\n      \"repair_family\": \"separate_self_touch_or_redo_boolean\",\n      \"next_step\": \"Inspect for coincident or tangent sheets meeting >2 ways; redo the boolean or add explicit clearance/relief in build123d code.\",\n      \"verify_after_repair\": \"Run export(..., 'step') so the written-and-reimported STEP passes the gate; validate() alone can miss round-trip failures.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"mesh_nonmanifold_edge\",\n      \"where\": [\n        -110.51,\n        -38.487,\n        -72.706\n      ],\n      \"shared_by_triangles\": 3,\n      \"hint\": \"two surface sheets meet >2-ways here (BRepCheck-valid but a CAD scorer rejects it) \\u2014 a self-touch; cut a thin relief or redo the boolean\",\n      \"diagnostic_class\": \"mesh_topology\",\n      \"repair_family\": \"separate_self_touch_or_redo_boolean\",\n      \"next_step\": \"Inspect for coincident or tangent sheets meeting >2 ways; redo the boolean or add explicit clearance/relief in build123d code.\",\n      \"verify_after_repair\": \"Run export(..., 'step') so the written-and-reimported STEP passes the gate; validate() alone can miss round-trip failures.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"diagnosis\": {\n    \"status\": \"defects_located\",\n    \"primary_kind\": \"brep_invalid_face\",\n    \"counts_by_kind\": {\n      \"brep_invalid_face\": 1,\n      \"mesh_nonmanifold_edge\": 5,\n      \"mesh_open_edge\": 95\n    },\n    \"diagnostic_classes\": [\n      \"brep_quality\",\n      \"mesh_topology\"\n    ],\n    \"repair_families\": [\n      \"rebuild_or_replace_bad_face\",\n      \"repair_nonconformal_face_junction\",\n      \"separate_self_touch_or_redo_boolean\"\n    ],\n    \"recommended_next_steps\": [\n      \"Open build123d://skill/repair and use the matching repair-family section.\",\n      \"Use face_index/where to inspect the local patch, then rebuild or replace that face explicitly in execute(); avoid broad opaque healing.\",\n      \"After each attempt, restore failed snapshots